                            (the next message output will be
             
            PLEASE WAIT
             
                            (At end of program the following message will
                            (be output
             
            DO YOU WISH TO RERUN PROGRAM
            PLEASE REPLY         YES/NO ?
             
                            (If the reply is YES the program will restart
